="00:32.220" end="00:32.520">don't </span><span begin="00:32.520" end="00:33.300">make </span><span begin="00:33.300" end="00:33.720">any </span><span begin="00:33.720" end="00:34.830">sudden </span><span begin="00:34.830" end="00:36.960">moves</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.020" end="00:42.690"><span begin="00:37.020" end="00:37.530">You </span><span begin="00:37.530" end="00:37.830">don't </span><span begin="00:37.830" end="00:38.490">know </span><span begin="00:38.490" end="00:38.670">the </span><span begin="00:38.670" end="00:39.270">half </span><span begin="00:39.270" end="00:39.570">of </span><span begin="00:39.570" end="00:39.960">the </span><span begin="00:39.960" end="00:42.450">abuse</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.690" end="00:44.220"><span begin="00:42.690" end="00:43.170">Welcome </span><span begin="00:43.170" end="00:43.380">to </span><span begin="00:43.380" end="00:43.530">the </span><span begin="00:43.530" end="00:43.800">room </span><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:43.860">of </span><span begin="00:43.860" end="00:44.220">people</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.220" end="00:46.830"><span begin="00:44.220" end="00:44.430">Who </span><span begin="00:44.430" end="00:44.580">have </span><span begin="00:44.580" end="00:44.820">rooms </span><span begin="00:44.820" end="00:44.910">of </span><span begin="00:44.910" end="00:45.210">people </span><span begin="00:45.210" end="00:45.360">that </span><span begin="00:45.360" end="00:45.510">they </span><span begin="00:45.510" end="00:45.840">loved </span><span begin="00:45.840" end="00:46.200">one </span><span begin="00:46.200" end="00:46.800">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.830" end="00:48.120"><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:47.250">Docked </span><span begin="00:47.250" end="00:48.090">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.120" end="00:50.190"><span begin="00:48.120" end="00:48.450">Just </span><span begin="00:48.450" end="00:48.720">because </span><span begin="00:48.720" end="00:48.810">we </span><span begin="00:48.810" end="00:49.080">check </span><span begin="00:49.080" end="00:49.200">the </span><span begin="00:49.200" end="00:49.590">guns </span><span begin="00:49.590" end="00:49.710">at </span><span begin="00:49.710" end="00:49.860">the </span><span begin="00:49.860" end="00:50.160">door</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.190" end="00:53.730"><span begin="00:50.190" end="00:50.550">Doesn't </span><span begin="00:50.550" end="00:50.730">mean </span><span begin="00:50.730" end="00:50.850">our </span><span begin="00:50.850" end="00:51.240">brains </span><span begin="00:51.240" end="00:51.330">will </span><span begin="00:51.330" end="00:52.080">change </span><span begin="00:52.080" end="00:52.230">from </span><span begin="00:52.230" end="00:52.530">hand </span><span begin="00:52.530" end="00:53.670">grenades</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.730" end="00:56.820"><span begin="00:53.730" end="00:54.210">You're </span><span begin="00:54.210" end="00:54.600">lovin' </span><span begin="00:54.600" end="00:54.780">on </span><span begin="00:54.780" end="00:54.840">the </span><span begin="00:54.840" end="00:55.470">psychopath </span><span begin="00:55.470" end="00:55.860">sitting </span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.100">next </span><span begin="00:56.100" end="00:56.160">to </span><span begin="00:56.160" end="00:56.790">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.820" end="00:59.160"><span begin="00:56.820" end="00:57.210">Never </span><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.420">know </span><span begin="00:57.420" end="00:57.540">the </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:58.140">murderer </span><span begin="00:58.140" end="00:58.530">sitting </span><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:58.770">next </span><span begin="00:58.770" end="00:58.830">to </span><span begin="00:58.830" end="00:59.160">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.160" end="01:02.400"><span begin="00:59.160" end="00:59.430">You'll </span><span begin="00:59.430" end="00:59.880">think </span><span begin="00:59.880" end="01:00.090">how'd </span><span begin="01:00.090" end="01:00.180">I </span><span begin="01:00.180" end="01:00.510">get </span><span begin="01:00.510" end="01:00.750">here </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:01.170">sitting </span><span begin="01:01.170" end="01:01.440">next </span><span begin="01:01.440" end="01:01.530">to </span><span begin="01:01.530" end="01:02.370">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.400" end="01:06.780"><span begin="01:02.400" end="01:02.580">But </span><span begin="01:02.580" end="01:02.970">after </span><span begin="01:02.970" end="01:03.300">all </span><span begin="01:03.300" end="01:03.420">I've </span><span begin="01:03.420" end="01:04.470">said </span><span begin="01:04.470" end="01:04.500"> </span><span begin="01:04.500" end="01:04.890">please </span><span begin="01:04.890" end="01:05.160">don't </span><span begin="01:05.160" end="01:06.780">forget</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.780" end="01:06.930"><span begin="01:06.780" end="01:06.855">watch </span><span begin="01:06.855" end="01:06.930">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.930" end="01:11.910"><span begin="01:06.930" end="01:07.200">All </span><span begin="01:07.200" end="01:07.440">my </span><span begin="01:07.440" end="01:07.950">friends </span><span begin="01:07.950" end="01:08.190">are </span><span begin="01:08.190" end="01:08.820">heathens </span><span begin="01:08.820" end="01:09.240">take </span><span begin="01:09.240" end="01:09.390">it </span><span begin="01:09.390" end="01:11.280">slow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.910" end="01:17.070"><span begin="01:11.910" end="01:12.480">Wait </span><span begin="01:12.480" end="01:12.840">for </span><span begin="01:12.840" end="01:13.110">them </span><span begin="01:13.110" end="01:13.530">to </span><span begin="01:13.530" end="01:13.890">ask </span><span begin="01:13.890" end="01:14.190">you </span><span begin="01:14.190" end="